<h2>Be Prepared to Wait</h2><br/>
When &zwnj;iOS 27&zwnj; and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipados-27/">iPadOS 27</a> become available as an over-the-air update, make sure your device is fully charged before you start the process over Wi-Fi, as it may take some time to complete. To check that the update is available, go to <strong>Settings ➝ General ➝ Software Update</strong>, and wait a moment for your device to contact Apple's servers. If you're in no rush, you can wait for &zwnj;iOS 27&zwnj; to be delivered to your iPhone when you next plug it into your computer.<br/>
